ter.com/MikagiVtuber https://youtube.com/@mikagich.-vu7qo?si=b6jR1y6kSbo3yBrW https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Y22l5Uipf2txaFXMiVFiZ30MBSnQm4Pl", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Aji_11300913/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2842979, "client_id": 2671944, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/903828de/uploads/origins/26ffd3b7-6d26-4be2-8f14-471c43f606c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1aad051d5b64c9622f7789bc9e16d76a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/903828de/uploads/origins/26ffd3b7-6d26-4be2-8f14-471c43f606c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5fc7bcfbcc2c7cc290dd3c2f7fd4f6a2", "src_set": ""}, "body": "AJI様の色彩やタッチがとても素敵で惹かれました…！\nもしよろしければ下記の創作キャラクター2人を描いていただけましたら嬉しいです。\n\n▽キャラクター資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1jUWEgSvnFkFyg1AEZQuWe7PnPAtkDZ5q?usp=sharing\n\n・構図等はお任せさせていただきます。\n\n・衣装は資料「05」もしくは「06」を参考にしていただけますと幸いです。\n男性のサングラスは基本不要ですが、シチュエーションやお好みによってお任せいたします。（サングラスありの場合、オンオフ切り替えできる仕様でお願いできますと幸いです）\n\n・資料「07」の②中期もしくは③後期のイメージでお願いできますと幸いです。\n\n\n▽ラフやアイディアスケッチなど、見させていただくことが可能でしたらpsd内に同封いただけますと嬉しいです…！\n不可の場合はラフについては遠慮なくスルーしてくださいませ。\n\n▽完全個人鑑賞目的／非商用にて、イラストを「印刷やグッズ制作」に使用させていただく可能性がございます。\n（制作したグッズを写真に撮ってSNSにアップさせていただく場合もございます）\nこちらNGでしたら、psd内にグッズ使用不可の旨をご記載いただけますと幸いです。\n\n上記ご検討の程、何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Aji_11300913/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2842979, "client_id": 3387021, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/57f5a756/uploads/origins/7303fdec-1c53-4a88-9eea-b4303a32f2d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ccf4250ff9c8c001d527c889711f6b6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/57f5a756/uploads/origins/7303fdec-1c53-4a88-9eea-b4303a32f2d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc4a4e4bb500382d3193eba6213bd68d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I really fell in love with your style! I'd like to request an illustration of two siblings.\n\n🎐 DEACON (兄) 173 cm\nA priest who gave up half of his soul to the darkness, to save Seraphina's life. A pacifist who dreams of freedom, is now cursed with the power to control the people who want to look at him. He is usually seen with a gentle smile. He plays instruments to accompany Seraphina's singing.\n※ Same hair and eye color as Seraphina. Bangs are swept to the left.\n\n🕊️ SERAPHINA (妹) 157 cm\nA healer who was blessed by the goddess, with the power to rejuvenate flowers and save people's lives by singing. A tsundere who speaks rudely and bluntly, but clearly cares for others no matter who they are. She is usually seen without a smile.\n※ Same hair and eye color as Deacon. Bangs are swept to the right.\n\nThemes: music and prayer, sunlight and birthday candles, flower fields blooming in winter, crows and doves, key and lock.\n\nPlease draw freely! Alternative clothing & composition OK!\n\nhttps://zippy-stealer-c43.notion.site/Deacon-Seraphina-10e17861336c80cdae1ecd74a53ebaaf", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Aji_11300913/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2842979, "client_id": 2178819, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c3633bd/uploads/origins/f6641ab5-efa5-4942-9a71-b8bb2694e353?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=20